   741 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   742 				; Set_Menu_Demo_Attrs - poke palette_id<<4 into the expanded attribute map's
   743 				; (MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM) cell covering each of the demo overlay's 8 squares,
   744 				; for all MENU_DEMO_SQUARE rows each square spans.  Plain CPU loop (no
   745 				; blitter - a small, one-time boot fixup, overriding whatever D:MENU.MAP
   746 				; supplied for just these cells).  MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM is exactly bank-
   747 				; aligned, so a running byte offset from its start splits cleanly into a
   748 				; bank number (offset's upper nibbles) and a window address (offset's low
   749 				; 12 bits) - recomputed every byte, since the covered rows straddle the
   750 				; $35xxx/$36xxx bank boundary partway through (row 25 already crosses it).
   751 				; Called once from start:, after Load_Menu_Banner_Raw.
   752 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
