   174 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   175 				; Make_Attr - Txt_Fg / Txt_Bg -> A = the VBXE text-mode colour byte:
   176 				;   bits 0-6 = foreground palette entry (0-127)
   177 				;   bit 7    = 1 when the background is opaque (Txt_Bg != 0), 0 = transparent
   178 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
