   712 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   713 				; Selector_HiRow - A = list index.  Recolours just that cell's name field
   714 				; (attribute bytes only, via the blitter - no glyph redraw), highlighted if the
   715 				; index == Sel_Index, else normal.  No-op if the cell isn't on screen.  Used by
   716 				; the nav keys: a cursor move only changes which cell carries the highlight.
