   874 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   875 				; Nfo_Name_MapSlot - Nfo_Name_Ord -> Ptr_Lo/Hi = the slot's $2000-window
   876 				; address, its VBXE bank ($2A..$2D) mapped in.  slot byte offset = Ord * 64:
   877 				; bank = $2A + (Ord >> 6), window page = $20 + ((Ord >> 2) & 15),
   878 				; window low = (Ord & 3) << 6.  (64 divides 4K, so a slot never straddles.)
   879 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
