   909 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   910 				; Nfo_Name_Emit - the slot Nfo_Name_MapSlot just mapped (at Ptr_Lo/Hi) in.
   911 				; Leaves Path_Buf[0..NFO_NAME_CAP-1] = the name (or all spaces if the slot
   912 				; byte 0 is < $21, i.e. "no name") + Path_Buf[NFO_NAME_CAP] = $00.  Window
   913 				; unmapped on return.
