   943 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   944 				; Nfo_Name_LoadManifest - open "D[n]:PATH IMAGES.LST", and for every record
   945 				; (8-byte key + source name + $9B) store the name into the matching *.MAP
   946 				; row's slot.  Called from Rescan_Images right after Nfo_Name_ClearCache.
   947 				; A missing / unreadable file just leaves every slot $00 (blank status line).
   948 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
