  1013 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1014 				; Nfo_Name_Match - the 8-byte key at Nfo_Name_Line in.  Linear-scans the *.MAP
  1015 				; group of the name list (rows FileStart .. ImageCount-1) in IMAGE_BANK for a
  1016 				; byte-exact match.  Returns A = ordinal (row - FileStart), C=0 on a hit;
  1017 				; C=1 and A undefined if none.  Maps + unmaps IMAGE_BANK itself.
  1018 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
