  1783 				; image is on screen; call this before returning to the selector so its
  1784 				; highlight follows the picture you were actually looking at, scrolling the
  1785 				; grid if the entry is off-screen.  Shares Sel_Top_For_Index with the nav keys.
  1786 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
